  "markdown": {
    "instructions": [
      "Choose one sizing approach consistently across the application wherever supported. Avoid mixing named fixed sizes (such as fontSize=\"sm\"), numeric fixed size tokens (such as w={10}), and projected $n tokens (such as w=\"$4\") within a layout: mixing scales can cause layout breakages across browsers and screen sizes.",
      "For applications designed to scale with screen width, prefer $n on supported sizing props. These values scale linearly with viewport width, not container width; test readability and layouts across target screens. Component size variants such as size=\"sm\" are separate fixed recipes and do not accept $n."
    ]
  },
